          "en": "I will show you one possible solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.64,
          "end": 12.6,
          "en": "and I will show you how I would build this starting screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.6,
          "end": 15.57,
          "en": "It all starts in this empty main.dart file of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.57,
          "end": 20.34,
          "en": "And there you learn that you must add a main function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.34,
          "end": 22.59,
          "en": "because this is kind of a special function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.59,
          "end": 25.86,
          "en": "which is automatically detected and executed by dart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.86,
          "end": 29.4,
          "en": "when your application starts on the target device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.4,
          "end": 31.68,
          "en": "This main function in the main.dart file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.68,
          "end": 34.62,
          "en": "is automatically detected and executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.62,
          "end": 36.09,
          "en": "And in this main function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.09,
          "end": 39.42,
          "en": "you must call a special function provided by Flutter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.42,
          "end": 40.95,
          "en": "the runApp function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.95,
          "end": 42.75,
          "en": "which then will take a widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.75,
          "end": 44.37,
          "en": "which then is the root widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.37,
          "end": 46.116,
          "en": "that will be drawn onto the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.116,
          "end": 48.6,
          "en": "and which will then contain all the other widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 48.6,
          "end": 50.746,
          "en": "as children and as descendants",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 50.746,
          "end": 54.15,
          "en": "to build the overall app user interface",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 54.15,
          "end": 57.3,
          "en": "as you learned it in the previous course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.3,
          "end": 59.4,
          "en": "There you also learned that runApp",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 59.4,
          "end": 62.261,
          "en": "is not available in this file out of the box,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.261,
          "end": 66.51,
          "en": "instead you have to import it from the Flutter framework",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.51,
          "end": 68.94,
          "en": "and you do this by adding the import keyword",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 68.94,
          "end": 71.03999999999999,
          "en": "and then the path to the file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 71.03999999999999,
          "end": 74.37,
          "en": "or to the package file that you wanna import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.37,
          "end": 77.78999999999999,
          "en": "And here we indeed wanna import from the Flutter package,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 77.78999999999999,
          "end": 81.15,
          "en": "hence we type package:flutter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.15,
          "end": 83.78999999999999,
          "en": "and then here it's the material.dart file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.78999999999999,
          "end": 86.37,
          "en": "which is the main import file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 86.37,
          "end": 87.93,
          "en": "when building Flutter apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 87.93,
          "end": 92.553,
          "en": "You will import most of the Flutter features from this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.84,
          "end": 95.43,
          "en": "So that's why we have to add it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.43,
          "end": 99.39,
          "en": "and with that we unlock this runApp function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.39,
          "end": 100.89,
          "en": "Now to this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.89,
          "end": 102.99000000000001,
          "en": "you must pass a widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 102.99000000000001,
          "end": 106.97999999999999,
          "en": "And typically here you start with the material app widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.97999999999999,
          "end": 108.37100000000001,
          "en": "which is one of the most important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 108.37100000000001,
          "end": 110.49000000000001,
          "en": "widgets provided by Flutter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 110.49000000000001,
          "end": 114.57,
          "en": "since this will basically wrap your overall user interface",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 114.57,
          "end": 118.11,
          "en": "and do a lot of behind the scenes setup work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 118.11,
          "end": 121.41,
          "en": "So that's typically the widget with which you start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 121.41,
          "end": 124.5,
          "en": "And later in this course you will also learn about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 124.5,
          "end": 128.25,
          "en": "the various named arguments that you can pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 128.25,
          "end": 130.29,
          "en": "to this widget constructor function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 130.29,
          "end": 133.86,
          "en": "because there are a lot of things you can configure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 133.86,
          "end": 137.346,
          "en": "about the overall app with help of this app widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 137.346,
          "end": 141.42000000000002,
          "en": "But for the moment we just need to set the home argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 141.42000000000002,
          "end": 143.4,
          "en": "the argument named home,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.4,
          "end": 144.9,
          "en": "this named argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 144.9,
          "end": 146.97,
          "en": "and we must set this to a widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 146.97,
          "end": 149.94,
          "en": "that should be displayed inside of our app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 149.94,
          "end": 152.28,
          "en": "because the material app widget itself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 152.28,
          "end": 154.073,
          "en": "doesn't really display anything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 154.073,
          "end": 156.15699999999998,
          "en": "instead it just provides a shell",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 156.15699999999998,
          "end": 159.93,
          "en": "with all that behind the scenes configuration work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 159.93,
          "end": 161.04,
          "en": "as I mentioned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 161.04,
          "end": 164.28300000000002,
          "en": "for the actual user interface we wanna display.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 165.63,
          "end": 168.276,
          "en": "Well, and here inside of MaterialApp,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 168.276,
          "end": 173.276,
          "en": "I'd like to set the Scaffold widget as my home widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 173.49,
          "end": 175.26,
          "en": "and that's another widget you saw",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 175.26,
          "end": 177.75,
          "en": "in the previous course section already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 177.75,
          "end": 179.46,
          "en": "because where MaterialApp",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 179.46,
          "end": 183.09,
          "en": "sets up the general app shell so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 183.09,
