        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 201.84,
          "end": 205.2,
          "en": "to configure some settings for the actual screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 205.2,
          "end": 207.63,
          "en": "that's displayed in my app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 207.63,
          "end": 210.54,
          "en": "And here for Scaffold at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 210.54,
          "end": 214.05,
          "en": "I just want to set the body argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 214.05,
          "end": 216.18,
          "en": "So a argument named body,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 216.18,
          "end": 218.01,
          "en": "accepted by Scaffold,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 218.01,
          "end": 222.513,
          "en": "and body just like home also wants a widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 223.44,
          "end": 227.16,
          "en": "So here we also must pass a widget as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 227.16,
          "end": 229.201,
          "en": "And the widget I wanna pass here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 229.201,
          "end": 232.571,
          "en": "will be my start screen widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 232.571,
          "end": 235.68,
          "en": "And for that I'll build a custom widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 235.68,
          "end": 238.32,
          "en": "Now we could include this Scaffold widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 238.32,
          "end": 241.072,
          "en": "into that start screen custom widget as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 241.072,
          "end": 242.52,
          "en": "as I just mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 242.52,
          "end": 245.76,
          "en": "that Scaffold does some screen specific setup work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 245.76,
          "end": 248.01,
          "en": "so including it into the screen widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 248.01,
          "end": 249.66,
          "en": "might make a lot of sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 249.66,
          "end": 253.391,
          "en": "But since I plan on sharing the same background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 253.391,
          "end": 256.947,
          "en": "and settings for all my screens in this app here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 256.947,
          "end": 260.28,
          "en": "I will actually use this here as a wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 260.28,
          "end": 262.71,
          "en": "around my different screens later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 262.71,
          "end": 266.177,
          "en": "And therefore I'll put my screen specific widget combination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 266.177,
          "end": 268.431,
          "en": "into a separate custom widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 268.431,
          "end": 270.93,
          "en": "that will then be passed as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 270.93,
          "end": 274.609,
          "en": "for this body argument to Scaffold thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 274.609,
          "end": 278.04,
          "en": "Hence, in this project in the lib folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 278.04,
          "end": 279.27,
          "en": "I'll add a new file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 279.27,
          "end": 281.372,
          "en": "because you learned in the previous section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 281.372,
          "end": 283.425,
          "en": "that it's considered a good practice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 283.425,
          "end": 286.17,
          "en": "to put custom widgets into their own files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 286.17,
          "end": 288.18,
          "en": "so that's what I'll do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 288.18,
          "end": 293.04,
          "en": "And I'll add a start_screen.dart file here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 293.04,
          "end": 295.17,
          "en": "Following that naming pattern,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 295.17,
          "end": 296.301,
          "en": "that naming convention",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 296.301,
          "end": 298.442,
          "en": "you learned about in the previous section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 298.442,
          "end": 301.8,
          "en": "where your file names should be all lowercase,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 301.8,
          "end": 304.386,
          "en": "and if they happen to consist of multiple words,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 304.386,
          "end": 307.363,
          "en": "these words should be separated by underscores",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 307.363,
          "end": 309.423,
          "en": "for better readability.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 310.74,
          "end": 313.74,
          "en": "So here it's the start_screen.dart file which I add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 313.74,
          "end": 315.651,
          "en": "And in there we create a custom widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 315.651,
          "end": 319.71,
          "en": "which as you learned is done with help of the class keyword",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 319.71,
          "end": 321.6,
          "en": "because we must create a class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 321.6,
          "end": 323.94,
          "en": "a blueprint for an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 323.94,
          "end": 325.2,
          "en": "Because remember,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 325.2,
          "end": 327.392,
          "en": "dart is an object oriented language,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 327.392,
          "end": 329.45,
          "en": "all values are objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 329.45,
          "end": 331.56,
          "en": "And for more complex values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 331.56,
          "end": 334.786,
          "en": "like widgets or configuration objects or anything like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 334.786,
          "end": 337.56,
          "en": "you use classes as blueprints",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 337.56,
          "end": 339.09000000000003,
          "en": "to basically tell dart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 339.09000000000003,
          "end": 341.67,
          "en": "how these objects should then be created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 341.67,
          "end": 344.73,
          "en": "and which kind of data and logic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 344.73,
          "end": 346.98,
          "en": "So functions should belong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 346.98,
          "end": 349.62,
          "en": "to the object that will be created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 349.62,
          "end": 352.527,
          "en": "Since these objects are all about organizing data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 352.527,
          "end": 354.54,
          "en": "and separating logic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 354.54,
          "end": 357.24,
          "en": "so that logic that works with certain data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 357.24,
          "end": 360.21,
          "en": "is co-located with that data in the same object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 360.21,
          "end": 362.01,
          "en": "and logic that does something else",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 362.01,
          "end": 364.83,
          "en": "is in a different object for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 364.83,
          "end": 367.948,
